          "settings": {
            "text": "<ol><li>Sublimation imprinting does not allow for white imprints on colors.<br/></li><li>IF your design requires white, please order <strong>WHITE COVERS ONLY.<br/></strong></li><li>Please keep in mind that colors printed on material other than white, may mix to change the final printed color. Since we cannot print white we cannot produce a white underlay to keep colors from mixing together.<br/><br/><em>(Example: blue on safety yellow may appear more green.)</em><br/></li><li>Maximum imprint size is <strong>19\"</strong> in diameter for all cover sizes. (We are sourcing new equipment for larger imprints in the near future.)<br/></li><li>Safety Orange Covers work best with dark imprint colors like black or navy blue.</li></ol>",
